# Ambiguous hand decomposition chooses the highest-paying interpretation (both directions)
# (rules.md §4 item 6).
# Double ron on Seat 0's 5m discard (honba=0, sticks=0):
# - Seat 1 (non-dealer, South): 2233445m 234p 678s + ron 5m
#   Reading A (sequences): 22m 345m 345m 234p 678s (ryanmen 5m) -> pinfu + iipeikou + tanyao = 3 han 30 fu = 3900.
#   Reading B (tanki): 234m 234m 55m 234p 678s (tanki 5m) -> iipeikou + tanyao = 2 han 40 fu = 2600.
#   Reading A pays more (3900 > 2600) and is chosen!
# - Seat 2 (non-dealer, West): 111222333p 456s 5m + ron 5m
#   Reading A (triplets): 111p 222p 333p 456s 55m (tanki 5m) -> sanankou = 2 han,
#     fu = 20 + 10 + 8 (111p) + 4 (222p) + 4 (333p) + 2 (tanki) = 48 -> 50 fu -> 3200!
#   Reading B (sequences): 123p 123p 123p 456s 55m -> iipeikou = 1 han 40 fu -> 1300!
#   Reading A pays more (3200 > 1300) and is chosen!
# Total Seat 0 pays: 3900 + 3200 = 7100.

